		<title>Disney Lorcana Reveals Update Fans Have Been Waiting For Since Launch</title>
		<link>https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/disney-lorcana-reveals-update-fans-have-been-waiting-for-since-launch/</link>
					<comments>https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/disney-lorcana-reveals-update-fans-have-been-waiting-for-since-launch/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Matthew Aguilar]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 02:57:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Gaming]]></category>
