					<description><![CDATA[<figure class="post-thumbnail"><img width="1056" height="594" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-Vs-Leroy.jpg?w=1056" class="attachment-1056x1056 size-1056x1056 wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" /></figure>

Disney Lorcana has already had a busy year with the releases of the delightful Winterspell and the Pixar spotlight set Into the Wild, but the fun&#8217;s far from over. The next set up to bat is Attack of the Vine, which will bring in characters from franchises like Monsters Inc. and Turning Red, and the [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<figure class="post-thumbnail"><img width="1056" height="594" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-Vs-Leroy.jpg?w=1056" class="attachment-1056x1056 size-1056x1056 wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" /></figure>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em><a href="https://comicbook.com/tag/disney-lorcana/" id="https://comicbook.com/tag/disney-lorcana/">Disney Lorcana</a></em> has already had a busy year with the releases of the <a href="https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/disney-lorcana-reveals-monsters-inc-cards-next-illumineers-quest-and-new-set-with-one-of-disneys-most-underrated-films/" id="https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/disney-lorcana-reveals-monsters-inc-cards-next-illumineers-quest-and-new-set-with-one-of-disneys-most-underrated-films/">delightful Winterspell and the Pixar spotlight set <em>Into the Wild</em></a>, but the fun&#8217;s far from over. The next set up to bat is Attack of the Vine, which will bring in characters from <a href="https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/four-of-pixars-best-films-are-finally-coming-to-disney-lorcana-and-one-is-happening-sooner-than-you-think/" id="https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/four-of-pixars-best-films-are-finally-coming-to-disney-lorcana-and-one-is-happening-sooner-than-you-think/">franchises like <em>Monsters Inc</em>. and <em>Turning Red</em></a>, and the set will also bring back Dual Ink cards and a spotlight on Floodborn cards. Ravensburger also revealed the first looks at not one but three upcoming sets throughout this year and next year, and we are breaking down everything we know right here.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before we dive into <em>Attack of the Vine</em>, let&#8217;s take a look at the upcoming <em>Lorcana</em> slate throughout 2026 and 2027. <em>Lorcana</em> revealed the first cards from the <em>Coco</em>-inspired <em>Hyperia City</em>, which include Miguel and Hector, but we also got the first look at the first set of 2027, <em>Into the Inkdark</em>. This set really seems to be honing in on the villains, with Hades and Captain Hook clearly visible, but there was one more surprise: the next set of 2027 will be one that includes a battle between Stitch and Leroy, and you can take a look at all three new sets below.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" height="586" width="1024" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?w=1024" alt="" class="wp-image-1686572" srcset="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg 2278w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=300,172 300w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=768,440 768w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=1024,586 1024w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=1536,879 1536w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=2048,1172 2048w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=2000,1145 2000w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=425,243 425w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=200,114 200w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Stitch-vs-Leroy-Tease.jpg?resize=1280,733 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-attack-of-the-vine-will-bring-back-dual-ink-cards-and-feature-a-spotlight-on-adventurer-winnie-the-pooh">Attack of the Vine Will Bring Back Dual Ink Cards and Feature A Spotlight on Adventurer Winnie the Pooh</h2>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" height="1024" width="733" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?w=733" alt="" class="wp-image-1686573" srcset="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg 1488w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=215,300 215w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=768,1073 768w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=733,1024 733w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1099,1536 1099w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1466,2048 1466w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1145,1600 1145w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=425,594 425w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=200,279 200w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-ChristopherRobin_HunnySage_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1280,1788 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 733px) 100vw, 733px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In addition to the new franchises entering the game, Attack of the Vine will also be bringing a few elements and characters from past sets into the spotlight. That includes the return of dual ink cards, which belong to two different inks. These cards are always incredibly versatile, but there are certain cards in Attack of the Vine that will make them even more powerful.</p>



