<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That brings us to the prominent featuring of Winnie the Pooh and friends in Attack of the Vine, which also ties into the upcoming The Great Hunny Rescue Illumineer&#8217;s Quest. The Hunny Wizard version of Winnie the Pooh was easily one of the early standouts in Lorcana, and now not only do we get more of these adventurer-style characters, but they can be formed into a truly powerful deck with the help of one key card.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" height="645" width="1024" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?w=1024" alt="" class="wp-image-1686582" srcset="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg 1720w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=300,189 300w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=768,484 768w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=1024,645 1024w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=1536,967 1536w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=425,268 425w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=200,126 200w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease.jpg?resize=1280,806 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That card is the dual ink Christopher Robin Hunny Sage, and the Gather the Party ability allows you to have other Hunny characters in your deck regardless of ink type. Turning Hunny into a keyword means you can create a deck that is powered by these beloved characters in a way that wasn&#8217;t possible before, and this set also includes many of Pooh&#8217;s friends, including Tigger and Roo. Christopher Robin also has an ability to search the deck for a Hunny card and put it in your hand when played, which can set you up in a huge way for the following turns or help boost your hand with more options.</p>



