<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Part of the Dual Ink return is also tied to team-ups, and there are several fans will love in this set. That includes a classic one in Belle &amp; Beast Certain as the Sun, and as you can see in the cards above, the rarer versions are simply stunning. These cards are also quite powerful, as Belle &amp; Beast features the Inspiring Dance ability, which means whenever this card quests, you ready all cards in your inkwell. You can also use Appreciative Audience to ready all your other characters for a cost of 6 ink.</p>



