</figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Ravensburger also shared new details and first looks at three of the upcoming sets after <em>Attack of the Vine</em>, with the first one being <em>Hyperia City</em>. As you would expect from a set based on Coco, the set has a heavy emphasis on singing, and it even features Un Poco Loco. <em>Hyperia City</em> will hit in October, but we already know what&#8217;s kicking off 2027.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" height="586" width="1024" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?w=1024" alt="" class="wp-image-1686593" srcset="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg 2278w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=300,172 300w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=768,440 768w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=1024,586 1024w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=1536,879 1536w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=2048,1172 2048w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=2000,1145 2000w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=425,243 425w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=200,114 200w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Into-the-Inkdark.jpg?resize=1280,733 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That would be the new set <em>Into the Inkdark</em>, which we know will have <em>Onward</em> making its <em>Lorcana</em> debut. That fits quite well with the Hades spotlight that will be part of the set, though there are teases of other villains in the new artwork as well, including Captain Hook. This set will hit in the first quarter of 2027, but <em>Lorcana</em> also shared the first details of the next set up to bat in 2027. There&#8217;s no name attached to that yet, but we know it will feature Stitch and Leroy thanks to the brand new artwork.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" height="576" width="1024" src="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?w=1024" alt="" class="wp-image-1686595" srcset="https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg 1920w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=300,169 300w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=768,432 768w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1024,576 1024w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1536,864 1536w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=425,239 425w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=200,113 200w, https://comicbook.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/06/Disney-Lorcana-Prerelease_Posters_EN-copy.jpg?resize=1280,720 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Attack of the Vine</em> will hit prerelease on July 17th and will fully release on July 24th. <em>The Great Hunny Rescue Illumineer&#8217;s Quest</em> will hit stores on October 2nd, while <em>Hyperia City</em> will hit prerelease on October 16th and will fully release on October 23rd. <em>Into The Inkdark</em> will release in the first quarter of 2027, while the unnamed Stitch vs Leroy set will release in the second quarter of 2027.</p>



